      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "，方法按生命周期分层使用：\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "1. **PEG**：适用于盈利为正、增速可验证"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "的中期成长；关键是增速口径一致（统一用未来12个月"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "或3年复合）并考虑增速的可持续年限。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "2. **DCF**：理论最完备，适合现金流可预测"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "的成熟成长；但终值占比常超70%，对永续增长率与"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "折现率极度敏感，必须附敏感性表。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "3. **PS / EV/Sales**：适用于"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "亏损或利润被投入压制的阶段；必须结合毛利率、单位"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "经济与未来利润率路径，否则跨公司不可比。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "4. **用户与单位经济模型**：LTV/CAC"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "、CAC回收期、留存/续费率、ARPU、Rule"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " of 40，用于判断“增长是否值钱”，是PS估值"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "的前提校验。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "5. **分层切换**：早期看PS与用户指标；盈利"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "转正后看PEG/EV/EBITDA；增速回落至成熟"
