      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "期后回归DCF/PE。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**主要局限**：高增长外推风险大，估值对假设高度"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "敏感；股权激励、可转债、并购带来的稀释常被忽略。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 四、方法选择与切换的判断条件\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**选择逻辑**：先判断利润是否为正且稳定，再判断"
