      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "/用户模型切到PEG/DCF；\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "5. 出现结构性变化（技术替代、政策永久改变供需"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "）→ 历史均值与周期框架同时失效，需下调中枢假设"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 五、常见误用与风险提示\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "1. **周期股用高峰盈利给低PE**：周期顶部的"
