      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "“低PE”往往是风险信号，峰值盈利不可持续；底部"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "亏损或高PE也不代表贵。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "2. **对成长股用静态PE或历史PE分位**："
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "忽视增长与生命周期，容易系统性误判。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "3. **PEG用短期高增长外推**：增速不可持续"
