      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "时PEG失真，应使用可持续增速并做衰减假设。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "4. **DCF终值过度乐观**：永续增长率高于"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "名义GDP、折现率过低、终值占比过高而未做敏感性"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_961851a525d449a58d88dac2e40e5c7d",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "5. **PS脱离单位经济**：毛利率、CAC回收"
